# read by steamling-seed-merge (verbs documented there)
never UI/DisplayWindowGeometry
never GameListTableView/HeaderState
never MemoryCards/*
never Filenames/BIOS
never SPU2/Output/*Volume
never SPU2/Output/OutputMuted
never SPU2/Output/DriverName
never SPU2/Output/DeviceName
never Hotkeys/*
never ~^Folders/(?!Bios$)
